  "bodyHash": "kBv4KvOCRw8=",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"line-height:40.6px\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:16px;color:#95a5a6\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dae454ec-919c-4131-8815-548548f78fdf.png\" alt=\"\"></h1><h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">想要自訂的 Minecraft FPS 武器模型與動畫嗎？槍械、近戰武器、紋理、換彈動畫等，全部在 Blockbench 中製作。快來看看：</span></h3><h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fiverr.com%252fs%252f5rWozN3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.fiverr.com/s/5rWozN3</a></span></h3><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkwork.com%252fanimation-3d%252f52100157%252fi-will-make-custom-minecraft-fps-weapon-models-in-blockbench%253fref%253d24079144\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">https://kwork.com/animation-3d/52100157/i-will-make-custom-minecraft-fps-weapon-models-in-blockbench?ref=24079144</span></a></span></h3><h1><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>❄️ 雪域生存 (Whiteout Survival)</strong></span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">你並非在舒適中誕生。</span><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">但也並非完全孤獨。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>雪域生存</strong></span>將你置於一個<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>寒冷、充滿氛圍的出生區域</strong></span>，附近存在著生存的跡象。小型建築、冰封細節和散落的趣味點塑造了初始體驗，而更廣大的世界則開放探索。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">寒冷奠定了基調——並非無法克服的挑戰，而是提醒你做好準備的重要性。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">這個世界關乎的是<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"> </span><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">沉浸感</span>與<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">耐力</span></strong>，而非人為的困難。<br><br></span></p><hr><h2><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><br>❄️ 寒冷開局體驗</span></strong></h2><ul>\n<li style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">雪地生態系的出生點，包含手工細節</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">附近暗示著過去生存痕跡的結構</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">超越冰凍區域的自然世界發展</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">原版遊戲體驗，無強迫規則</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">起始物品適中且符合主題，給予你立足之地，同時保留緊張感。</span><br><br></p><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong><br>📖 環境敘事</strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">透過建築與擺設進行微妙的敘事</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">無奇幻背景設定或腳本事件</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">營地、工具與冰封地標訴說著自己的故事</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">若你仔細觀察，環境會自我說明</span></li>\n</ul><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><br>🎯 這世界適合誰</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">✔</span> 喜愛氛圍式生存的玩家</span><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">✔</span> 喜歡探索精緻出生區域的玩家</span><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">✔</span> 想要不需模組就能體驗沉浸感的玩家</span><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">✔</span> 偏好自由勝於嚴格挑戰的玩家</span><br><br></p><hr><p><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>雪域生存</strong></span>並非刻意要致你於死地。</span><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">它只是讓寒冷定調——其餘的，交由你決定。</span><br><br></p><hr><h3><br><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">⚠️ 重要說明</span><br><br></strong></h3><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">這<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>不是</strong></span></span>一個硬核挑戰地圖。</span><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">世界中存在村莊與資源。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">雪域生存 </span></strong>關乎的是<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>感受</strong></span>，而非懲罰。</span></p>",
